<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="474739202"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1225108094"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="─to the future days"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MYTH &amp; ROID"/><amll:meta key="album" value="MYTH ＆ ROID 1stアルバム「eYe's」【通常盤】※読み：eYe's＝アイズ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:35.453"><div begin="00:16.639" end="04:02.507"><p begin="00:16.639" end="00:22.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">今ココロが動いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 心跳动了</span></p><p begin="00:24.754" end="00:30.576" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">その閉ざしたココロが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那颗尘封已久的心</span></p><p begin="00:32.695" end="00:35.621" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">I'm still alive, I'm still alive, I'm still alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还活着....在你眼中......我还活着</span></p><p begin="00:35.621" end="00:36.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">In your eyes</p><p begin="00:36.560" end="00:40.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I'm still alive, I'm still alive, I'm still alive</p><p begin="00:40.445" end="00:43.481" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">I'm with you now, I'm with you now, I'm with you now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我现在你身边....在你眼中</span></p><p begin="00:43.481" end="00:44.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">In your eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直不变的陪伴在身边</span></p><p begin="00:44.464" end="00:50.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">変わらずにそばに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如往昔 在你身边</span></p><p begin="00:51.284" end="00:55.562" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">I cast my wishes to the future days<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将祈愿寄托在未来</span></p><p begin="00:55.562" end="00:59.802" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">永遠の向こうで会えたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如能在永远的彼岸相逢</span></p><p begin="00:59.802" end="01:03.703" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">I cast my wishes to the future days<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将祈愿寄托在未来</span></p><p begin="01:04.139" end="01:08.432" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">何から話そうか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要从何说起呢</span></p><p begin="01:08.432" end="01:16.634" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">悲しみさえ 喜びさえ やがて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连悲伤就连喜悦 终于</span></p><p begin="01:16.634" end="01:25.617" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">等しく眠る そうやって生きてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">平等地沉眠了</span></p><p begin="01:32.684" end="01:38.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">その世界が叶えば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果那个世界能成为现实</span></p><p begin="01:40.722" end="01:46.636" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">誰も傷つかないの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何人都不会受伤吗</span></p><p begin="01:48.671" end="01:51.626" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Imagining, Imagining, imagining<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虚构......在你眼中.....虚构</span></p><p begin="01:51.626" end="01:52.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">In your eyes</p><p begin="01:52.570" end="01:55.772" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Imagining, Imagining, imagining</p><p begin="01:56.569" end="01:59.467" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">I see it now, I see it now, I see it now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我此时窥视到了......在你眼中</span></p><p begin="01:59.467" end="02:00.493" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">In your eyes</p><p begin="02:00.493" end="02:07.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">わからないけれど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管不太明白</span></p><p begin="02:07.778" end="02:11.492" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">If you can dream it, I can believe it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若你能想象到,我就能相信着</span></p><p begin="02:11.492" end="02:15.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">人は涙なくしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人即使失去眼泪</span></p><p begin="02:15.611" end="02:19.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">If you can dream it, I can believe it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若你能想象到,我就能相信着</span></p><p begin="02:20.115" end="02:26.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">優しくなれるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是否能够变得温柔</span></p><p begin="02:40.700" end="02:44.552" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">絶望にも 命にも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝望也好命运也好</span></p><p begin="02:44.552" end="02:48.548" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">やがて終わりが来て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于迎来了终结</span></p><p begin="02:48.548" end="02:51.916" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">手渡してく未来は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲手交出的未来</span></p><p begin="02:51.916" end="02:56.296" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">なるがままになって</p><p begin="02:56.296" end="02:58.475" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Spin it, spin it, spin it 'round<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将时针转个圈</span></p><p begin="02:58.475" end="03:00.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Spin it, spin it 'round</p><p begin="03:00.177" end="03:04.178" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">くるくる回る時計針<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轱辘轱辘转动的时针</span></p><p begin="03:04.178" end="03:08.161" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">ひらひら落ちる花のように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如飘落的花一样</span></p><p begin="03:08.161" end="03:12.367" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">咲いたなら散れ 刹那に待って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">盛开后在飘零的刹那间飞舞</span></p><p begin="03:13.482" end="03:17.642" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">I cast my wishes to the future days<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将祈愿寄托在未来</span></p><p begin="03:17.642" end="03:21.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">永遠の向こうで会えたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如能在永远的彼岸相逢</span></p><p begin="03:21.610" end="03:25.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">I cast my wishes to the future days<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将祈愿寄托在未来</span></p><p begin="03:25.867" end="03:29.521" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">何から話そうか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要从何说起呢</span></p><p begin="03:29.521" end="03:33.424" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">If you can dream it, I can believe it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若你能想象到,我就能相信着</span></p><p begin="03:33.424" end="03:37.679" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">どんな未来でもいいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论怎样的未来都好啊</span></p><p begin="03:37.679" end="03:42.588" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">If you can dream it, I can truly believe it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若你能想象到,我就能相信着</span></p><p begin="03:42.614" end="03:46.035" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">ただ想いはせる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只不过是思念而已</span></p><p begin="03:46.035" end="03:48.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Spin it, spin it, spin it 'round<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将时针转个圈</span></p><p begin="03:48.257" end="03:49.588" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Spin it, spin it 'round</p><p begin="03:49.588" end="03:53.624" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">I cast my wishes to the future days<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将祈愿寄托在未来</span></p><p begin="03:53.624" end="03:56.245" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">Spin it, spin it, spin it 'round</p><p begin="03:56.245" end="03:57.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Spin it, spin it 'round</p><p begin="03:57.778" end="04:02.507" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">I cast my wishes, I cast my wishes, oh-oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我寄托祈愿.....oh oh oh</span></p></div></body></tt>